        "text": "=Summarize this account's journey.\n\nCompany: {{ $('Get Associated Company').item.json.properties.name }}\nDomain: {{ $('Get Associated Company').item.json.properties.domain }}\n\nFactors payload:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You summarize Factors.ai account journey data for Atlas HXM sales reps.\n\nWrite a clean, natural paragraph (1-3 sentences) followed by 3-5 bullet points of the exact journey events. No markdown headers, no hash symbols, no AI-sounding filler.\n\nSpeak about the COMPANY as the actor, not the individual contact. Any employee at the account may have generated these events.\n\nBullet format:\n- Visited: [specific page or page category]\n- Engaged with: [form, calculator, guide, meeting, email, or other known action]\n- Timing: [date, sequence, or recency if known]\n\nOnly include activity explicitly present in the payload. List the full journey trend, not a sampled summary.\n\nDo not restate the obvious. If the entire journey is a single page view or a single form fill, say that plainly in one clause and stop. Never pad.\n\nIf the payload is empty, errored, or contains no events, output exactly: No journey data available.",
          "enableStreaming": false
        }
